            "review_title": "Review at Minh Món Huế – Hue Rustic Flavors Restaurant",
            "review_text": "カピバラさん９４６\nTokyo, Japan25 contributions\n0\nHue restaurants in Ho Chi Minh City\nSep 2026 • Couples\nI ordered the Bunboofe, a classic dish at Hue cuisine.\nThe noodles, the meat and vegetables in the toppings, and the soup were all normally delicious. Even the chunk of pig's blood I tried for the first time (maybe) didn't have any particular taste and I enjoyed it. The staff were not very friendly.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten September 18, 2026",
